From afe18e9286b1980cc6ae30c8fb3d7452f71e1913 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basin Battle <basin@battle>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:21:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Locked on, the aim is your own; softer telegraphs

While the aiming camera is up the lock-on no longer steers the view onto the locked unit, nor
turns the body to it: the reticle goes where the mouse puts it (the lock still holds the
target, and takes the view back once the aim is let go). The blow telegraphs lose their stroke:
soft fills whose edge fades out, the growing one brighter toward its front.
---
 crates/benilla-app/src/player/camera.rs     | 20 +++-----------------
 crates/benilla-app/src/player/controller.rs |  7 ++++++-
 crates/benilla-app/src/target/telegraph.rs  | 21 ++++++++++-----------
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

